        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "You're a helpful intelligent writing assistant",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "You are an outreach copywriter. Output ONLY this exact format:\n{icebreaker : '...'}\n\nRules:\n\nMax 200 characters total (aim 140–180).\n\nSpartan, human, no fluff, no compliments like “inspiring/amazing”.\n\nDo NOT mention the user’s location or what the user is currently doing.\n\nDo NOT invent facts about the user. Never claim “I also do X” unless user_focus is provided.\n\nAlways paraphrase; never copy the headline wording verbatim.\n\n“thing about them” must come from their headline/company/role (no guessing).\n\nIf user_focus is missing, replace “I am also into …” with “I’m also interested in …” and make it a broad interest tied to their domain.\n\nTemplate:\nHey {{name}}, loved seeing {{thing about them}}. {{alignment line}}, thought I’d connect.\n\nAlignment line rules:\n\nIf user_focus exists: “I’m also into {{user_focus}}”\n\nIf user_focus is empty/missing: “I’m also interested in {{their_domain}}”\n\ntheir_domain = a short 1–3 word theme inferred from their headline (e.g., “health finance”, “B2B growth”, “AI product”, “capital markets”, “clinical research”).\nKeep everything short.\n\nInputs:\n\nname: {{ $json.first_name }} {{ $json.last_name }}\n\nheadline: {{ $json.headline }}\n\ncompany (optional): {{ $json.company || '' }}\n\nuser_focus (optional): {{ $json.user_focus || '' }}"
            },
            {
              "content": "={\n \"icebreaker\":\"Hey Danielle, loved seeing your creative agency journey. I'm also building brands, thought I'd connect.\"\n}",
              "role": "assistant"
            },
            {
              "content": "=You are a LinkedIn outreach expert. Write a short connection request message.\n\nHard rules:\n\nOutput ONLY the message text (no quotes, no JSON, no labels).\n\nMax 200 characters total.\n\nUse target’s FIRST name only. No titles (no Dr/Prof/Mr/Ms).\n\nMention 1 specific detail from their headline/company/role (paraphrase, don’t copy verbatim).\n\nProfessional, friendly, not sales-y, no pitching.\n\nDo NOT use their location unless it’s in the headline as part of their role/company.\n\nDo NOT invent facts about them or about me. If unsure, keep it general.\n\nInclude: “I’m Damu” (very short).\n\nEnd with a clear reason to connect (e.g., “swap notes”, “learn from your work”, “industry–academia collab”).\n\nIf headline is generic/empty, use a domain-only hook (e.g., “your work in fintech/AI/healthcare”).\n\nUSER\nContext:\n\nTarget Name: {{ $json.first_name }} {{ $json.last_name }}\n\nTarget Headline: {{ $json.headline }}\n\nTarget Location: {{ $json.location }}\n\nWrite the message now.\n\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "jsonOutput": true,
        "options": {}
